<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="es" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v2"/><ttm:agent type="other" xml:id="v2000"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" leadingSilence="0.040"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="en-US"><text for="L1">I have one percent left</text><text for="L2">And I’ll use it just to tell you how sorry I am</text><text for="L3">If they see me with someone else at a club, I’m only wasting my time</text><text for="L4">Baby, why would I lie to you</text><text for="L5">About them seeing me happy, no, that’s not true</text><text for="L6">Nothing makes me laugh anymore</text><text for="L7">Only when I look at the pictures and videos I have of you</text><text for="L8">I went out with someone else to forget you and she had on the perfume that you like</text><text for="L9">I light one up to go to sleep</text><text for="L10">Because I sleep better if I dream that you're here</text><text for="L11">If you knew that I wrote to you</text><text for="L12">I haven’t sent you the messages, they're all still there</text><text for="L13">Wow</text><text for="L14">It's cost me so much</text><text for="L15">Perhaps I did you a favor when I left your side</text><text for="L16">Drunk, looking at your pictures</text><text for="L17">It hurts me to see that you're doing better</text><text for="L18">You don’t have gray days, the scars don’t hurt you anymore</text><text for="L19">And I’m wondering if I should tell you that</text><text for="L20">I have one percent left</text><text for="L21">And I’ll use it just to tell you how sorry I am</text><text for="L22">If they see me with someone else at a club, I’m only wasting my time</text><text for="L23">Baby, why would I lie to you</text><text for="L24">About them seeing me happy, no, that’s not true</text><text for="L25">Aye, I hadn’t thought about you in a long time</text><text for="L26">I went to your Insta while drunk</text><text for="L27">Baby, I already know you're doing well</text><text for="L28">That you don’t want to know about me, aye, aye</text><text for="L29">Living in a hell that I myself set on fire</text><text for="L30">Playing with you as if I were the ten</text><text for="L31">I feel like I’m no longer in your heart</text><text for="L32">Now I’m at your feet</text><text for="L33">Begging you</text><text for="L34">Drowning in tequila</text><text for="L35">The guys are inviting me out</text><text for="L36">I have a good time, but I always end up missing you</text><text for="L37">Drowning in tequila, aye</text><text for="L38">Girls texting me, aye</text><text for="L39">Asking where the party is today, but</text><text for="L40">I have one percent left</text><text for="L41">And I’ll use it just to tell you how sorry I am</text><text for="L42">If they see me with someone else at another club, I’m only wasting my time</text><text for="L43">Baby, why would I lie to you</text><text for="L44">About them seeing me happy, that’s not true, aye</text><text for="L45">That is</text><text for="L46">Grupo Frontera</text><text for="L47">Y our buddy Bad Bunny</text></translation></translations><songwriters><songwriter>Andres Jael Correa Rios</songwriter><songwriter>Benito A. Martinez Ocasio</songwriter><songwriter>Edgar Barrera</songwriter><songwriter>Marcos Borrero</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata>
